    "name": "Synapse: Lockdown",
    "steam_appid": 2511300,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/9079bb5ad89cc4b04f6f038cb5dcfefc.avif?t=1750057659\" data-has-big /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203b A co-op FPS Survival Horror Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a member of the exploration organization Hermes sent inside the threatened city of Pantheon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to visit different locations in the city to complete the assigned missions and ensure your safe escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather weapons and items while collaborating with your teammates to confront the unknown threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/adb2b837aa1fde379ea7be4b9ce80dd0.poster.avif?t=1750057659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/adb2b837aa1fde379ea7be4b9ce80dd0.webm?t=1750057659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/adb2b837aa1fde379ea7be4b9ce80dd0.mp4?t=1750057659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203b Sci-Fi Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Synapse: Lockdown,&quot; players confront the artificial intelligence that has seized control of the facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The AI unit is made of steel. It is resistant to the majority of weapons, and it continuously watches and tracks the players\u2019 actions throughout the facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is only a sense of powerlessness and fear of death that remains with the players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/8274e003cc3efb9c64042c595c41ba89.poster.avif?t=1750057659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/8274e003cc3efb9c64042c595c41ba89.webm?t=1750057659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/8274e003cc3efb9c64042c595c41ba89.mp4?t=1750057659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203b An Ever-Evolving Seeker: Minerva</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Synapse: Lockdown&quot;, the AI Minerva does not simply adhere to predetermined routines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It actively responds to the player's actions.\u00a0<br><br>Minerva remembers your actions. If you repeatedly apply the same tactics or choose the easier paths, Minerva will eventually begin to employ varied patterns to counteract this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to employ a variety of tactics against a changing enemy, and work together to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/0cbcb418710cd5a156ffc7210bfe400d.poster.avif?t=1750057659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/0cbcb418710cd5a156ffc7210bfe400d.webm?t=1750057659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/0cbcb418710cd5a156ffc7210bfe400d.mp4?t=1750057659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203b Exploration and Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside the facility, players can acquire tools or weapons with various functions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tools gather data like the location and status of robots to protect you from potential threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These tools can also generate noise or obstruct vision to affect the enemy's behavior patterns and defend against attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players are continually challenged to utilize these tools effectively and appropriately, depending on the type of enemies they face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/409f8abfb9c4291c3f150a5a504ee042.poster.avif?t=1750057659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/409f8abfb9c4291c3f150a5a504ee042.webm?t=1750057659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/409f8abfb9c4291c3f150a5a504ee042.mp4?t=1750057659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203b The synergy between fear and cooperation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's only so much players can do on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain missions necessitate ongoing cooperative play, including sharing information from different locations during exploration, as well as synchronization efforts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will encounter many missions that require constant co-op play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convey information quickly and accurately to collaborate effectively under time pressure and in the face of ongoing threats from the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/9d63d161005d8d45dbf5b4a7f6a043fd.poster.avif?t=1750057659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/9d63d161005d8d45dbf5b4a7f6a043fd.webm?t=1750057659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/9d63d161005d8d45dbf5b4a7f6a043fd.mp4?t=1750057659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203b Unveil the truth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The exploration of every section in the city of Pantheon establishes unique phases in &quot;Synapse: Lockdown&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through each stage, you\u2019ll encounter new enemies, missions, gimmicks, events, stories, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies will possess distinct shapes, behaviors, and weaknesses tailored to various thematic settings, including laboratories, hospitals, and educational institutions in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The missions players undertake will change accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As stages are gradually unlocked, players will discover the truth about the AI Minerva.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300c OPORD_001 : DAWN \u300d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Class: CLASS - II</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distributee: All personnel assigned to the international exploration organization 'Hermes'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purpose: Identify the reason for Minerva\u2019s outburst and restore it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: All viewing logs are automatically sent to the Control Center</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Collaborate with your teammates to navigate the city, survive challenges, and uncover the truth about AI Minerva.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/59159f11a5574f12e1d93de72c367760.poster.avif?t=1750057659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/59159f11a5574f12e1d93de72c367760.webm?t=1750057659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/59159f11a5574f12e1d93de72c367760.mp4?t=1750057659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/9079bb5ad89cc4b04f6f038cb5dcfefc.avif?t=1750057659\" data-has-big /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203b A co-op FPS Survival Horror Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a member of the exploration organization Hermes sent inside the threatened city of Pantheon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to visit different locations in the city to complete the assigned missions and ensure your safe escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather weapons and items while collaborating with your teammates to confront the unknown threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/adb2b837aa1fde379ea7be4b9ce80dd0.poster.avif?t=1750057659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/adb2b837aa1fde379ea7be4b9ce80dd0.webm?t=1750057659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/adb2b837aa1fde379ea7be4b9ce80dd0.mp4?t=1750057659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203b Sci-Fi Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Synapse: Lockdown,&quot; players confront the artificial intelligence that has seized control of the facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The AI unit is made of steel. It is resistant to the majority of weapons, and it continuously watches and tracks the players\u2019 actions throughout the facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is only a sense of powerlessness and fear of death that remains with the players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/8274e003cc3efb9c64042c595c41ba89.poster.avif?t=1750057659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/8274e003cc3efb9c64042c595c41ba89.webm?t=1750057659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/8274e003cc3efb9c64042c595c41ba89.mp4?t=1750057659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203b An Ever-Evolving Seeker: Minerva</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Synapse: Lockdown&quot;, the AI Minerva does not simply adhere to predetermined routines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It actively responds to the player's actions.\u00a0<br><br>Minerva remembers your actions. If you repeatedly apply the same tactics or choose the easier paths, Minerva will eventually begin to employ varied patterns to counteract this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to employ a variety of tactics against a changing enemy, and work together to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/0cbcb418710cd5a156ffc7210bfe400d.poster.avif?t=1750057659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/0cbcb418710cd5a156ffc7210bfe400d.webm?t=1750057659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/0cbcb418710cd5a156ffc7210bfe400d.mp4?t=1750057659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203b Exploration and Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside the facility, players can acquire tools or weapons with various functions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tools gather data like the location and status of robots to protect you from potential threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These tools can also generate noise or obstruct vision to affect the enemy's behavior patterns and defend against attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players are continually challenged to utilize these tools effectively and appropriately, depending on the type of enemies they face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/409f8abfb9c4291c3f150a5a504ee042.poster.avif?t=1750057659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/409f8abfb9c4291c3f150a5a504ee042.webm?t=1750057659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/409f8abfb9c4291c3f150a5a504ee042.mp4?t=1750057659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203b The synergy between fear and cooperation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's only so much players can do on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain missions necessitate ongoing cooperative play, including sharing information from different locations during exploration, as well as synchronization efforts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will encounter many missions that require constant co-op play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convey information quickly and accurately to collaborate effectively under time pressure and in the face of ongoing threats from the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"b