ve challenges, and uncover the truth about AI Minerva.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/59159f11a5574f12e1d93de72c367760.poster.avif?t=1750057659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/59159f11a5574f12e1d93de72c367760.webm?t=1750057659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511300/extras/59159f11a5574f12e1d93de72c367760.mp4?t=1750057659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Synapse: Lockdown&quot; is a co-op FPS survival horror game. As a member of the Hermes team, you're deployed to the threatened city of Pantheon. Explore facilities, complete missions, and escape safely. Gather weapons and items, and work with your team to face unknown horrors.",
